<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia sees inflation rate under 4.5 pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>Tunisia sees inflation rate under 4.5 pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's annual inflation rate is expected to be under 4.5 percent by the end of 1996, Tunisian President Zine al-Abidine Ben Ali said on Saturday.</p>
<p>Inflation as measured by the Consumer Price Index was 6.3 percent in 1995 mainly because of effects of drought on food prices. It was 4.7 percent in 1994.</p>
</text>
